{"id":1309735,"imdb":"tt34734841","en":"Once Upon a Time in Gaza","orig":"كان ياما كان في غزة","ar":null,"tag":null,"ov":"In 2007, Yahya works at his friend Osama’s falafel shop in Gaza, which doubles as a drug dealing front. His entanglement leads him to witness a terrible crime. A couple years later, Gaza’s Ministry of Culture randomly chooses Yahya to star in a TV series that highlights martyrs and heroes of the resistance. As conflict simmers in the distance, Yahya unexpectedly receives real weapons, heightening the stakes as the show provides him with an opportunity to confront the perpetrator of the offense that changed his life.","rd":"2025-06-25","rt":87,"g":[18],"lang":"ar","budget":0,"revenue":0,"companies":[{"n":"Les Films du Tambour","logo":"/v2OFEFeiZuVd9iLYlQ0BwkiUHgv.png","c":"FR"},{"n":"Kometa Films","logo":"/ntorO1ENCoeCnnA1F7HeWS2oZ7U.png","c":"FR"},{"n":"Made in Palestine Project","logo":"/tCrpZxvSXb0LOz5NeEEd3qNzjhC.png","c":"PS"},{"n":"Ukbar Filmes","logo":"/lTvO3MFX5eogjWEpWmLUipxeKVi.png","c":"PT"},{"n":"Riva Film","logo":"/6xN0FuEK9yXaK2jvWjSW2YxwOYG.png","c":"DE"},{"n":"Jordan Pioneers","logo":null,"c":"JO"}],"countries":["FR","PT","DE","GB","PS","AE","JO","QA","SY"],"langs":["Arabic"],"col":null,"rel":[{"c":"FR","d":"2025-06-25"},{"c":"AM","d":"2025-07-17"},{"c":"AU","d":"2025-08-14"},{"c":"ID","d":"2025-09-28"},{"c":"TR","d":"2025-10-05"},{"c":"US","d":"2025-10-05"},{"c":"HK","d":"2025-10-30"},{"c":"EG","d":"2025-11-14"},{"c":"PH","d":"2025-11-14"},{"c":"GB","d":"2025-11-20"},{"c":"MA","d":"2025-12-01"},{"c":"SE","d":"2026-01-27"},{"c":"GR","d":"2026-02-05"},{"c":"DE","d":"2026-02-12"},{"c":"BY","d":"2026-07-30"},{"c":"RO","d":"2026-08-12"}],"dir":["Arab Nasser","Tarzan Nasser"],"prod":["Rani Massalha"],"wri":["Arab Nasser","Tarzan Nasser","Marie Legrand","Amer Nasser"],"mus":["Amine Bouhafa"],"dop":["Christophe Graillot"],"cast":[{"n":"Nader Abd Alhay","ch":"Yahya","p":"/jVtweuxfcPj1LuPHs0lMxE1KmBm.jpg"},{"n":"Majd Eid","ch":"Osama","p":"